:"musthear","grp":null,"list_year":null,"rank":778,"year":null,"note":null,"total":946,"scaruffi":null}],"podcast":[{"kind":"podcast","title":null,"body":"Like other Dead Grips releases, *Monistor* generated significant anticipation and is highly regarded by some fans, especially those who appreciate the band's earlier work. Samples and fragments from *Monistor* are being reused in *Gear of the Sneech*, contributing to the album's return-to-roots sound. \"sobre todo de Monistor y ya no le ha gustado mucho lo que han hecho al resto\"","year":2012,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"Music Radar Clan","episode":"DEATH GRIPS - YEAR OF THE SNITCH ya está aquí","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HtcOpYWN_6I"}]},{"kind":"podcast","title":null,"body":"This album, referred to as \"demonistor\" in the transcript, was the band's first official full-length release, positioned as something between an EP and an LP. The band caused a major dispute with Epic Records by controversially releasing it for free before its official market release as a physical record. Critics raved about the album, which further increased the popularity of their earlier mixtape, Ex-Military. \"La crítica al Lucina con demonistor, de hecho eso hace subir todavía más la popularidad del mixtape de Ex-Military.\"","year":2012,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"Music Radar Clan","episode":"¿Pero quiénes son DEATH GRIPS?","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GADSlIqGcmE"}]},{"kind":"podcast","title":"First Official Album","body":"This album, referred to as \"demonistor\" in the transcript, was the band's first official full-length release, positioned as something between an EP and an LP. The band caused a major dispute with Epic Records by controversially releasing it for free before its official market release as a physical record. Critics raved about the album, which further increased the popularity of their earlier mixtape, Ex-Military. \"La crítica al Lucina con demonistor, de hecho eso hace subir todavía m